+  "slug": "ashen-compact",
+  "title": "The Ashen Compact",
+  "summary": "A demanding Shadow Knight helmet campaign in Kael · Not released.",
+  "body": "<h2 id=\"availability\">Not released</h2><p>This candidate is built for testing, not yet available on the live server.</p><h2 id=\"start\">A warlord’s challenge</h2><p>At level 50, with Shadow Knight in any held class slot, speak to Drazhul Blackmantle near Befallen in West Commonlands. Accept before creating a run at the adjacent Kael Keeper. Difficulty is intended for a developed Shadow Knight main; reaching level 50 alone does not establish readiness.</p><h2 id=\"story\">The stolen war-fire</h2><p>A renegade war cult in Rallos Zek’s giant city binds stolen souls into its standards. Break its claim and temper its war-fire into your own helm. These characters and events are original Nightcap fiction; you do not kill Rallos Zek or the original Avatar of War.</p><h2 id=\"route\">Fourteen duties</h2><ol><li>Enter your Ashen Compact expedition</li><li>Defeat the Herald of the Iron Oath</li><li>Claim the Standard of Conquest</li><li>Claim the Standard of Dread</li><li>Claim the Standard of Dominion</li><li>Protect Veyra&#x27;s binding through three waves</li><li>Defeat Marshal Kharzug</li><li>Claim the oath of the Knight of Hunger</li><li>Claim the oath of the Knight of Ruin</li><li>Claim the oath of the Knight of Defiance</li><li>Defeat General Vhalek</li><li>Defeat the Echo of Endless War</li><li>Temper the Warhelm at the War Altar</li><li>Return to Drazhul and claim your helm</li></ol><h2 id=\"counterplay\">Survive the Compact</h2><p>The Herald warns before his warcry: interrupt or leave its radius. Protect Veyra and control three waves. Kharzug summons two owned war souls at half health. Vhalek and the Echo mark your position with three seconds to move more than ten paces or interrupt. Named champions resist charm and fear; their war souls remain controllable. The final Echo can flurry. Full route and build-specific balance still require player testing.</p><h2 id=\"progress\">Keep your progress</h2><p>Be alive, enrolled and nearby for personal boss credit. Pet kills credit eligible owners. Completed duties survive reconnects and run resets; removing the Tasks display does not erase them. Make room for both story and dungeon journals. Return to Drazhul after tempering the helm. A full inventory leaves delivery pending; a durable receipt prevents duplicate claims.</p><h2 id=\"rewards\">The Warhelm</h2><p><a href=\"item-990510.html\">Warhelm of the Ashen Compact</a> is a one-time custom reward based on the Warhelm of Rallos Zek appearance. Camil’s item remains separate. <a href=\"zone-kael.html\">Browse all fourteen proposed Kael rewards</a>. The enclosed Classic model package is staged; native rendering and animation acceptance remain pending.</p>",
+  "category": "World",
+  "status": "Not released",
+  "updated": "2026-10-24",
+  "sources": [
+    "docs/quests/warhelm/SPEC.md",
+    "docs/quests/warhelm/install-rows.json",
+    "docs/quests/warhelm/QA.md"
+  ]
+}
