e beginning</h3><div><p>Allowed AA ranks open at level 1. With AA allocation at 0%, earn full leveling XP plus two AA per level. The AA +/− controls work from level 1; choose 100% to pause leveling and focus on AA. Points and prerequisites still matter.</p><a href=\"multiclass.html#passive-abilities\">Understand AA progression →</a></div></section><section class=\"feature-row\"><h3>Scribe spells ahead of time</h3><div><p>Eligible scrolls can enter your spellbook early. Memorizing and casting still require the normal level for a class you hold.</p><a href=\"multiclass.html#spell-access\">Learn the spell rules →</a></div></section><section class=\"feature-row\"><h3>A roster of companions</h3><div><p>Multiple summoned pets, selected-pet or All-pets commands, and stored pet armor support a multiclass roster.</p><a href=\"pets.html\">Manage your pets →</a></div></section></div><h2 id=\"rewards\">Earn, trade and upgrade your gear</h2><div class=\"feature-list\"><section class=\"feature-row\"><h3>Stronger item qualities and zone rewards</h3><div><p>Ordinary tiered gear and the 48-zone reward hunt offer distinct quality families. Hunt augments fit six armor locations and add heroic stats.</p><a href=\"zone-hunt.html\">Explore rewards and sockets →</a></div></section><section class=\"feature-row\"><h3>Turn duplicates into upgrades</h3><div><p>Use three Base zone rewards for Polished, then four matching copies for each higher step. Veyra’s reusable box also upgrades eligible ordinary Polished and Exalted items. The box also accepts <a href=\"item-upgrades.html#normal-items\">three identical eligible Normal/Base copies for Polished</a>.</p><a href=\"item-upgrades.html\">See the upgrade recipes →</a></div></section><section class=\"feature-row\"><h3>Free trading and no LORE limit</h3><div><p>Trade formerly restricted and attuned items and keep duplicate LORE items. Inventory space, temporary lifetime and other item rules still apply.</p><a href=\"equipment.html#free-trade\">Rea