on repairs</h2><p>The latest updates repair shared creature animations and Enchanter weapon-pet identity. Beetle walking and death were confirmed fixed; pet motion and wider visual checks continue.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"october-release\">October 17 gameplay update</h2><p>Close EverQuest and choose Play to receive the Recommended AA window and independent Monk attack timers. Latest update lists these changes with death EXP, stack limits, reforging and reliability improvements. Previous patches retains the dungeon launch notes.</p><h2 id=\"ashen-compact\">The Ashen Compact — not released</h2><p><a href=\"ashen-compact.html\">The Ashen Compact</a> is a prepared level-50 Shadow Knight helmet campaign in a curated Kael expedition. It is not yet installed. Client appearance and complete encounters still require in-game acceptance.</p><p>The staged Warhelm appearance needs the paired Classic client archives. Current launcher releases do not yet contain it; do not manually mix candidate files into the installed client.</p>",
