fer all 21 Classic combat dungeons, including Fear, Hate and Sky. Hail to choose Raid or Grind, enter, or join your group leader; use <code>#instances</code> for open runs and timers. Runs last 12 hours. Only the creator can confirm a reset, with no players, pending entries or recoverable corpses inside. Earned reward claims and permanent completion counts survive reset and expiry. The small floating-eye Keeper is separate from the waypoint portal.</p>\n<p class=\"notice\"><strong>Live testing:</strong> <a href=\"dungeon-modes.html\">Raid and Grind dungeon modes</a> are available from all 21 dungeon Keepers. Existing legacy runs keep their original behavior until expiry or reset. Gameplay and balance acceptance remain open.</p>\n<h2 id=\"chapterhouse-candidate\">The Vigil of the Dawn — live testing</h2><p>A dedicated Keeper near Befallen in West Commonlands opens Chapterhouse expeditions. The zone uses a scoped level-50 exception; Classic remains the global era. Exits return to West Commonlands. <a href=\"camil-vigil.html\">Read the quest guide</a> and <a href=\"zone-chapterhouse.html\">reward catalog</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ashen-compact\">The Ashen Compact — not released</h2><p><a href=\"ashen-compact.html\">The Ashen Compact</a> is a prepared level-50 Shadow Knight helmet campaign in a curated Kael expedition. It is not yet installed. Client appearance and complete encounters still require in-game acceptance.</p><p>Drazhul and the Kael Keeper stand together near Befallen in West Commonlands. The public Kael foyer contains services; its Keeper controls private runs. The scoped exception does not unlock Velious globally.</p>",
